		"experimental": false,
		"readmeComment": "The color temperature range differs per model: 2700-5700 K (ceiling5), 3000-5700 K (ceiling16, ceiling17), 2700-6300 K (ceiling21), 2700-6000 K (ceiling22, ceiling23), 2700-6500 K (others). Other scenes can be sent with the `commands` channel, for example `set_scene[\"ct\",3000,50]` or `set_scene[\"auto_delay_off\",50,10]` (brightness 50%, off after 10 minutes)"
	}
